heaGo-scaffold uses the architecture of Done-0/gin-scaffold as a design reference:
https://github.com/Done-0/gin-scaffold
Reference commit: 22e3136bc4d09505824f2ca391d6fa20309790b6
Upstream license: Apache License, Version 2.0.

This template implements its own configuration, lifecycle, PostgreSQL integration,
Sa-Token-Go adapter and settings services. It preserves a similar separation of
configuration, startup, routing and HTTP controllers; it is not an upstream fork.
Third-party dependencies retain their own licenses; see go.mod and go.sum.
